# PraiseWall Project Rules

- Stack: React (Vite) + Express + SQLite
- Project root: E:\Projects\testimonial-platform
- P0 first: submit → dashboard → wall must work end-to-end
- No auth, no multi-tenant, no email — per assignment brief
- API JSON uses camelCase; DB uses snake_case
- Keep diffs minimal; match existing code style
